PREAMBLE (non-operative)

Jash is the sovereign shell and execution attestation fabric of the Beyond
operating system ecosystem: every command in its execution chain is
attested, every claim about its state is measurable, and its lineage is
recorded honestly. This license keeps the code as free as the artifact
is sovereign. Sovereignty is a property of the artifact — an attested
build and execution chain — never a restriction placed on you. This
preamble states intent only; the TERMS below are the entire license.

